abstract: |
  A CPU-native runtime for deterministic local-propagation inference, based on
  the Differential Activity Principle (PAD). uint16 fixed-point, bit-exact
  across architectures, no GPU required. Implementation and experiments were
  developed in collaboration with Anthropic Claude (Opus 4.6 / 4.7); see
  AUTHORS.md for the full provenance statement.
